pOWONCKKKRHadVO4S9YP2BvL7n-CGRzEJb9qPuFaqfJTaGc1tzjCRUdB23E5Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzvvsTpLICR_lZ2yKR_W2-1T__TKX7qdbLcEZkY1l5K3Q&oe=69BEA7C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ScreenShot_10.png", "id": "981308963494230", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_981308966827563_5041963651491784421_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bhy4b7uw7NQQ7kNvwHExS9K&_nc_oc=Adn7FhEtw6N0wbJjV1s1wFOlBN-OqK-PTk9qLchZmVD7Tg-RZyfHZzX10aYNC07PSmI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzvyzlyPBUaVI__KDeqZCSZmJCmn9di68mvLtPBc4nv4w&oe=69BE82D6"}, "display_name": "FingFing", "keywords": [], "long_description": "When you press your finger on the ground, the character moves with a \"Fing\" sound. \nThis is the only control in this game, you don't need a controller, just \"Fing\" the ground with your index finger, and you can clear all the stages of the game. \n\n{469790078996779}\n\nYou can unlock 6 cute characters, and you can choose the main character for each stage. \nYou can play a total of 300 stages. when you clear the last stage, you can watch a concert of the 6 characters. \n\n\"FingFing\" is organized into four categories of games.\n Crossing the road, Find the maze, Block floor, Memorization\n\nImmerse yourself in a casual puzzle game filled with cute spaces and cute characters.  Master the art of finger movement and challenge yourself with increasingly complex levels. \n\n1. Crossing the road\n{468079492518832}\n\n2. Find the maze\n{1746179812456480}\n\n3. Block floor\n{1200729004441377}\n\n4. Memorization\n{1041506847592682}", "short_description": "\"FingFing\" a VR healing puzzle game played entirely with your fingers"}]}, "developer_name": "AroundEffect Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aroundeffect.blogspot.com/2021/07/aroundeffect-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AroundEffect